@startuml

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActivityBorderColor black
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black

|User|
start
:1. Selects Part (Part 1 - Part 7);
:2. Clicks Practice;

|System|
:3. Validates exam and part number;

if (Valid?) then ([Yes])
  :4. Queries questions for selected Part;

  if () then ([Found Questions])
    :5. Creates practice ExamAttempt entity;
    :6. Saves attempt to database;
    :7. Loads Part questions (no countdown timer);

    |User|
    :8. Views practice page;

  else ([No Questions Found])
    :5. Displays error message;

    |User|
    :6. Views error;
  endif

else ([No])
  :4. Displays validation error;

  |User|
  :5. Views error;
endif

stop

@enduml
